  $ ./client -p 9090 --mode idle   x 10 (connect, send nothing)
  server children while the 10 clients are connected: 10
  the test ends the clients that are still waiting
  clients answered "ERROR server busy": 0
  server log:
    | 16:03:15.755 [server:1866] INFO  robustness: [1] reap ON | [2] ignore SIGPIPE ON | [3] length limit ON | [4] max clients OFF | [5] pdeathsig ON

